                            {
                                "target_word": "Kartographie",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7ed308e3-2916-398c-ae7b-c7b5391efbc8",
                                        "entry_id": "d83e0a0c-9195-3d1d-b87c-4a20076ac241",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Fachgebiet der Verarbeitung von Geoinformationen und deren Darstellung und Kommunizierung in Landkarten und Seekarten"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8e016243-6cc2-499c-88a8-3cba069675cb",
                                                "sense_id": "7ed308e3-2916-398c-ae7b-c7b5391efbc8",
                                                "text": "Die Geschichte der Kartographie in der westlichen Welt, so wie sie üblicherweise gelehrt wird, stützt diese Vorstellung: Danach gab es einen steten Fortschritt von groben mittelalterlichen Weltbildern bis hin zu Darstellungen mit dem heutigen Genauigkeitsstandard."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c528b157-5348-4ab3-94ec-fca1e21416bf",
                                                "sense_id": "7ed308e3-2916-398c-ae7b-c7b5391efbc8",
                                                "text": "Nach dem vorgeblich gesicherten Stand der Wissenschaft ist der Beginn der Kartographie, von unbedeutenden Vorversuchen abgesehen, in den altägyptischen und babylonischen Hochkulturen zu lokalisieren."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "254c07c2-6276-4b9b-9edd-724fb3b502ae",
                                                "sense_id": "7ed308e3-2916-398c-ae7b-c7b5391efbc8",
                                                "text": "Von Humboldt war eines der letzten naturwissenschaftlichen Universalgenies. Physik, Chemie und Biologie waren ihm ebenso vertraut wie Astronomie, Geologie und Kartographie."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ddc48e3c-5fa8-4039-aeb6-70270652e36b",
                        "source_entry_id": "6aa84a37-52e9-34c8-8468-b9770e9d6ff2",
                        "source_sense_id": "949686ae-970f-3d03-8ee5-729ccc1013b2",
                        "source_sense_description": "de kunst en wetenschap van het vervaardigen van land-, zee- en/of luchtkaarten",
                        "target_lang_word": "cartography",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "cartography",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8f777ff0-6042-3833-879b-30139702ddea",
                                        "entry_id": "84221afc-c1e8-3a50-91ae-f3f3ad541362",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The creation of charts and maps based on the layout of a territory's geography."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "48750ed6-8bc4-3b9b-b51d-31398c4facc5",
                                        "entry_id": "84221afc-c1e8-3a50-91ae-f3f3ad541362",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An illustrative discussion of a topic."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "045ebb7d-049c-4005-8837-872e7329e631",
                                                "sense_id": "48750ed6-8bc4-3b9b-b51d-31398c4facc5",
                                                "text": "In the early years of my psychedelic research, I sketched a vastly expanded cartography of the psyche that seems to meet this challenge."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2aed9af0-c5ba-4cab-b871-93a95821dd5f",
                                                "sense_id": "48750ed6-8bc4-3b9b-b51d-31398c4facc5",
                                                "text": "The Dalit feminist standpoint, and more specifically the national Federation of Dalit Women, provide in very clear terms a cartography of governance that forces an official reckoning of a new way of seeing."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5950f318-296a-45dd-bc9c-b01d67e3bf9b",
                                                "sense_id": "48750ed6-8bc4-3b9b-b51d-31398c4facc5",
                                                "text": "Since this cartography is not a representation of already existing spaces or cinematic forms but is rather oriented towards the new, it could be described as a cartography of the virtual; however, since Ruiz's work makes a point of departing from the normative rules of cinematic construction as a first principle, this book will outline Ruiz's cartography of images as a cartography of the impossible."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "53e7907b-d18a-4d4a-b714-7d18e426ff20",
                                                "sense_id": "48750ed6-8bc4-3b9b-b51d-31398c4facc5",
                                                "text": "In short, the volume aims to provide the reader with the coordinates for current debates in global art and to develop a cartography of the various conceptual and methodological intersections that global art studies is addressing today."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5eccc711-48f7-47ec-9d26-a4d279cb9d0f",
                        "source_entry_id": "6aa84a37-52e9-34c8-8468-b9770e9d6ff2",
                        "source_sense_id": "949686ae-970f-3d03-8ee5-729ccc1013b2",
                        "source_sense_description": "de kunst en wetenschap van het vervaardigen van land-, zee- en/of luchtkaarten",
                        "target_lang_word": "cartographie",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "cartographie",
